NAME: do-while GT at equality
DESCRIPTION: GT is strict: with x = y the body runs once and the loop exits; fixed in i-7d2612-fffa6c, see behtests/dowhile_gt_equal.beh
SRC:
(let (x 3)
  (let (y 3)
    (seq
      (JMP (Dir 2))
      (DAT (store x) (store y))
      (do-while (GT x y)
        (NOP)) )))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

  JMP    $2     , #0     
LET1  
LET2  
  DAT    #3     , #3     
DWH9  
  NOP    #0     , #0     
  SLT.BA $LET2  , $LET1  
  SNE.AB #0     , #1     
  JMP    $DWH9  , #0     
  DAT    #0     , #0     